## Current Test Program

The current K2 test runs the full Rock/Paper/Scissors task interaction.

The first user task:

    creates the name server
    creates the RPS server
    creates four RPS clients
    exits

The RPS server:

    registers itself as "rps"
    receives signup requests from clients
    pairs clients into games
    receives play requests
    replies with game results
    handles quit requests

The RPS clients:

    find the RPS server using WhoIs("rps")
    sign up to play
    play two rounds
    quit

This test exercises Send, Receive, Reply, RegisterAs, WhoIs, the name server, the RPS server, and multiple RPS clients.

