## Performance Measurement Completion

The performance measurements have been completed for all 48 required cases.

The results are stored in:

    PerfResults.csv

The CSV contains one header row and 48 data rows. The measured cases cover:

    optimization: opt, noopt
    cache mode: none, icache, dcache, both
    order: S, R
    message size: 4, 64, 256 bytes

The build system supports the following options for reproducing the measurements:

    make OPT=-O3 CACHE=none MODE=PERF PERF_ITER=1000
    make OPT=-O3 CACHE=icache MODE=PERF PERF_ITER=1000
    make OPT=-O3 CACHE=dcache MODE=PERF PERF_ITER=1000
    make OPT=-O3 CACHE=both MODE=PERF PERF_ITER=1000

    make OPT=-O0 CACHE=none MODE=PERF PERF_ITER=1000
    make OPT=-O0 CACHE=icache MODE=PERF PERF_ITER=1000
    make OPT=-O0 CACHE=dcache MODE=PERF PERF_ITER=1000
    make OPT=-O0 CACHE=both MODE=PERF PERF_ITER=1000

Each performance build runs the six baseline cases in one boot:

    S,4
    S,64
    S,256
    R,4
    R,64
    R,256

The output reports the average Send/Receive/Reply transaction time in microseconds.

